{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56700","headline":"五言诗四首 四 · 无名氏","name":"五言诗四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学问非今日，[唯]（〖维〗从龙晦说改）须[积]（迹）年多。\n[□]（郭沫若补「请」字）看[千涧]（阡蕳）水，万合始[成]（城）河。\n（後四字均从翮沫若说改。\n以上四首，出处均同前。\n）（按：卜天寿《论语》抄本後附抄五绝六首，郭沫若以爲仅第一首爲卜无法寿自作，龙晦则以爲第一、第五首皆出其自作。\n除其自作之一二首外，余皆系抄录旧作，二家意见大致相同。\n今收第一、第五两首入本书卷四卜天寿，余皆收於此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}